952637179\" data-id=\"48299170788\"></div></div></div></div></div><h2 data-identifyelement=\"1126\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1198\"></h2><hr data-identifyelement=\"1199\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"1126\" id=\"FAQs\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1127\">FAQs</strong></h2><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1684909831302\" data-identifyelement=\"1128\" id=\"Q1:-Can-I-add-text-or-stickers-to-my-Instagram-Stories-through-the-Instagram-Story-Post-Composer-in-Social-Planner?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1684951832443\" data-identifyelement=\"1129\">Q1: Can I add text or stickers to my Instagram Stories through the Instagram Story Post Composer in Social Planner?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1130\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1131\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">A1: Text and stickers can't be added to Instagram stories through third-party APIs like Social Planner. You would need to add these elements directly to the Instagram app.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1684909861473\" data-identifyelement=\"1132\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1133\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1684909896528\" data-identifyelement=\"1134\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Q2:-&nbsp;Can-I-tag-people-or-businesses-in-my-stories-through-Social-Planner?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1135\" dir=\"ltr\">Q2: &nbsp;Can I tag people or businesses in my stories through Social Planner?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1684909902934\" data-identifyelement=\"1136\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1684909919065\" data-identifyelement=\"1137\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">A2: Tagging people or businesses in Instagram stories through third-party tools is impossible. This feature is generally limited to the Instagram app itself. However, Instagram's policies and features may change, so we recommend checking Instagram's official API documentation (<a data-identifyelement=\"1138\" href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram/sharing-to-stories\">https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram/sharing-to-stories</a>) or contacting our support team for the most recent information.</span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004993-view-custom-form-submissions-appointment-side-drawer-", "title": "Overview", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044766911/original/gqa8kkG92zs2dm7a6Frjgda8TJqgTSI8hg4310.jpg?1744171904"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#What%E2%80%99s-New?\">What\u2019s New?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Use\">How to Use</a></li><li><a href=\"#Important-Notes\">Important Notes</a></li><li><a href=\"#Use-Cases\">Use Cases</a></li></ul><hr><h2 data-end=\"208\" data-start=\"195\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Overview\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Overview</h2><p data-end=\"496\" data-start=\"209\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The <strong data-end=\"238\" data-start=\"213\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">View Form Submissions</strong> feature allows users to see responses from custom booking forms directly within the <strong data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"323\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Appointment Modal</strong>. This eliminates the need to navigate to the Forms module or Contacts to review details, making your scheduling workflow faster and more seamless.</p><hr data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"501\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"503\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What\u2019s-New?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">What\u2019s New?</h2><ul data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"522\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"522\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"524\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"558\" data-start=\"524\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Forms Tab in Appointment Modal</strong><br data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"561\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">A new <strong data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"569\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Forms</strong> tab appears within the Appointment Modal if the appointment has a <strong data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"645\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">custom form</strong> submission attached.</p></li><li data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"683\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"685\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"685\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Structured Submission View</strong><br data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"718\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Submitted form responses are displayed in a clean, structured format that mirrors the layout of the Forms module.</p></li><li data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"835\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"837\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"837\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Access from Anywhere</strong><br data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"864\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Whether you're in the <strong data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"888\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Calendars</strong>, <strong data-end=\"915\" data-start=\"903\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Contacts</strong>, or <strong data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"920\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conversations</strong> tab, clicking on an appointment will show the <strong data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"984\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Forms</strong> tab if applicable.</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"837\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155044766911/original/gqa8kkG92zs2dm7a6Frjgda8TJqgTSI8hg4310.jpg?1744171904\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155044766911\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><hr data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1019\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-Use\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">How to Use</h2><ol data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1037\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1037\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1040\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1040\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Navigate to Calendars</strong><br data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1068\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Go to your Calendar and click on any recent appointment.</p></li><li data-end=\"1211\" data-start=\"1129\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1211\" data-start=\"1132\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1132\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Open Appointment Modal</strong><br data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1161\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Click the appointment card to open its details.</p></li><li data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1213\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1216\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1216\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Check for the Forms Tab</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">If a custom form was submitted during the booking process, a <strong data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1310\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Forms</strong> tab will be visible in the modal.</p></li><li data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1355\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1358\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1358\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">View Form Responses</strong><br data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1384\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Click the Forms tab to see a detailed, structured view of the submission.</p></li></ol><hr data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1465\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1467\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Important-Notes\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Important Notes</h2><ul data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1490\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1490\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1492\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This feature supports <strong data-end=\"1537\" data-start=\"1516\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">only custom forms</strong> added to the booking flow.</p></li><li data-end=\"1663\" data-start=\"1567\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1663\" data-start=\"1569\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1572\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Form submissions will appear only for appointments created on or after April 9, 2025.</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1834\" data-start=\"1664\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1834\" data-start=\"1666\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1693\" data-start=\"1669\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Default booking form</strong> submissions (Name, Email, Phone) do <strong data-end=\"1744\" data-start=\"1730\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">not appear</strong> in the Forms tab at this time, since this data is already shown in the Contact section.</p></li><li data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1835\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1837\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0p