data-start=\"1951\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Quickly review intake questions and custom data before a meeting.</p></li><li data-end=\"2057\" data-start=\"2017\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2057\" data-start=\"2019\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Reduce back-and-forth between modules.</p></li><li data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"2058\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"2060\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Improve customer experience with more informed conversations.</p></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006602-conversation-ai-summary-and-transcript", "title": "Conversation AI Summary and Transcript", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565015/original/cJ6faP4eZgpDw0Fue1iqTTE4DWy1yy0_nQ40ab.jpg?1759968755", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565013/original/M3JIq98NbTVV60_i4Htq-5M1WlAQj7kHQQ34a7.jpg?1759968754"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">In the Conversation AI Bot settings there is an option to generate a summary and/or transcript of the conversation.</p><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conversation Summary</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Navigate to AI Agents &gt; Conversation AI and select an existing bot or create a new one.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">On the Bot Goals tab, click the toggle for Enable Conversation Summary.</li></ol><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(44, 92, 197); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">By default, no summary will be generated for the conversation. The toggle has to be switched on to generate a summary.\n\nAlso, by default, the summary will not be saved anywhere. The summary needs to be sent somewhere and/or saved in a separate action to be retained.</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565015/original/cJ6faP4eZgpDw0Fue1iqTTE4DWy1yy0_nQ40ab.jpg?1759968755\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565015\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conversation Summary Settings</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Set inactivity time</strong> - For example, 15 minutes with no messages from user or bot. This is an additional way to put this bot to sleep (on top of the Bot Settings &gt; Max Messages, or Conversations &gt; switch bot to inactive, Bot Goals &gt; Stop Bot, etc). <a href=\"155000006603.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Conversation AI - Bot Inactive (Sleep) Conditions</a><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Minimum messages required to generate summary</strong> - If the conversation has fewer total messages than this minimum a summary will not be generated even when the inactivity time expires.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Trigger a workflow</strong> - Select workflow from dropdown. This is <strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">required if you want to save the summary in the CRM and this workflow must be triggered from the Conversation AI.</strong></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">In Automation -&gt; Workflows create a workflow <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">without a trigger</strong>.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Add an action (ex: Update Contact Field).<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Add merge fields like Conversation AI-&gt; Summary and Conversat